{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"k4flow","type":"text","text":"ActorInfo事务与Host请求流程\n1. 调用方明确选择TryExecuteAvatarActorInfoTransaction／TryBootstrapAvatarActorInfoTransaction／TryReplaceRevokedAvatarActorInfoTransaction，传原Context、明确Kind／ClearMode、必需同步纯谓词和独立OutPublication。\n2. 入口清输出、Reserve原Operation；进入IsAvatarBindingNativeWriteBusy所描述的RAII窗口。谓词外调前后核对原Operation、Admission对应Current／Unissued／Revoked和原端点，撤销后不复活。\n3. 限定Super：Init→InitAbilityActorInfo；Clear/PreserveOwner→Init(owner,null)；ClearActorInfo→ClearActorInfo；Refresh→RefreshAbilityActorInfo。\n4. Super完整返回后重检→Commit→保存原Kind／Before的不可变Receipt；只有本次真正提交才bCommitted=true和非空凭据。失败明确返回，无改动作／回滚／自动排队；退出仅清原Operation。\n5. Receipt.TryGetCommittedEvidence只读历史，不证明当前执行或Ready；ASC持有唯一当前资源引用。\nHost Request→三Try之一→提交→Extension Install→Host公布原H/Context/Avatar→Publish。Health/Base/Hero消费各自原H，失败结果不授权后继动作。","x":0,"y":1750,"width":1850,"height":250,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"k4cancel","type":"text","text":"原归属取消与Cue清理\n1. 原清理调用方 → TryCancelAvatarBindingAbilities(捕获的原Context, 显式With／Without, 必需纯原资源Query)；Host已调用，先Withdraw原H再取消/全输入退休/Cue保旧Avatar/显式ClearMode。\n2. 校验Query存在／Busy；外调前复制标签与null模式 → Reserve原Cancel Operation → 同一native Busy作用域。\n3. Query前后按MatchCommittedCleanupContext重检原Operation/Context/原allocation/完整快照及CommittedCleanup目的；成功才关闭匹配原Context发布许可，不撤Binding。\n4. 一次限定Super::CancelAbilities → 完整遍历及原生列表锁析构 → 返回重检 → Complete；均在同一Busy窗口。真实回调内新绑定／取消明确Busy，不自动排队。\n5. Succeeded：仅同步原生调用返回，bCommitted=false、CommittedContext空，无Receipt／Notice；不可取消或WaitingToExecute不承诺End。完整返回后才允许合法后继。\n6. 原归属失效：明确Stale，只退自己的Operation，不追加Clear／输入／Cue／Montage，不清后继、不回滚已发生取消。null With不筛选、非null空With匹配零。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#原归属限定取消（C1a）|接口与边界]]\nCue清理：原清理调用方→TryRemoveAvatarBindingGameplayCues(原Context,pureQuery)→Remove Reserve／同一native Busy→原归属重检→关匹配发布许可→Super::RemoveAllGameplayCues一次完整返回→重检／Complete。失败仅退原Operation，不签Commit／Notice；原生仅Active Tag／预测，不等于异步全清。[[AbilitySystem/结构#原归属限定Cue清理（C1b）|Cue契约]]","x":0,"y":3280,"width":1850,"height":520,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"k4-cleanup-sources-nav","type":"text","text":"## 两种来源分别认证｜承接上方ActorInfo事务与清理\n第一行：已提交原Context；第二行：完整native Init返回后未commit失败的原WrittenActual。均不借Ready或当前端点猜来源。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#清理调用方|清理接口]]","x":0,"y":3850,"width":3720,"height":150,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"k4-committed-cleanup-check","type":"text","text":"## A2｜纯GT核原提交来源\nCurrent或Revoked＋实际保存原提交快照 → 比精确Context/LastWrite/Issuer、原ActorInfo allocation/完整字段。\nCommittedCleanup允许仍合法分配、Destroy中的原Owner/Avatar；ASC无效/字段变了明确失败。\n逻辑撤销保留仅cleanup资格；工作查询仍Current/live。\n查询不签身份/执行/Ready；真实typed/legacy写入已经退休旧源则拒绝。","x":710,"y":4100,"width":620,"height":260,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"k4-committed-cleanup-stale","type":"text","text":"## A拒绝｜原来源或scope不符\nCheck/原Query明确Stale/Failed/Reason；不猜当前来源，不执行后续Cancel/Cue/Clear，不清后继。\n已经返回的原生动作只保留历史，不回滚；原关闭资源本地清理按自身生命周期负责。","x":710,"y":4690,"width":620,"height":190,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"k4-failed-init-no-proof","type":"text","text":"## B无认证Proof｜原失败保留\n捕获/保留不满足原场景时明确失败；单次诊断ASC/Operation/Owner/Avatar及FailureReason/ProofReason。\n不在cleanup入口重捕当前来源，不猜旧Context、不当成功或重试另一动作。","x":1440,"y":5940,"width":620,"height":160,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"k4-failed-init-cleanup-failure","type":"text","text":"## B清理失败｜不提升原Init\n写前原Proof/Query不符→拒绝该次Clear。\nnative已Clear后，原query/后置条件失效→明确失败，Proof已经消费，不重授来源。\n两种结果均无commit/Receipt/Notice/Ready，原Init失败保留。","x":2980,"y":5940,"width":740,"height":160,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"grant","type":"text","text":"1. 状态宿主创建 ASC 与基础属性，并按 AbilitySet 授予 GA / GE。\n\n调用：CombatantState 构造 ASC/属性 → CharacterSlot::InitializeForPawnData(PawnData) → AbilitySet::GiveToAbilitySystem(ASC, Handles, Source)。","x":-960,"y":343,"width":385,"height":230,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"request","type":"text","text":"2. Hero观察原ActionInstance，固定原deadline，调用ReceiveAbilityInputRequest取得原ID。\n真实Retry→QueueAbilityInputRetry；Released／Invalidated→EndAbilityInputRequest。\nPlayerController::PostProcessInput→Process逐边沿冻结来源→原InputScope内受控Try→按bNativeAccepted消费输入。\nremote接受不证明本地Activation；Boss BT Query不携玩家输入证明。","x":-100,"y":273,"width":385,"height":370,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"nav","type":"text","text":"# AbilitySystem｜流程图\n能力请求→受控Try→原激活身份→动作与Task→原资源清理→全部调用退出后发布Completed。\nRequiredPose路径先Acquire再原生Tick Poll；失败先EndTask，再发送OnFailed，由GA决定原能力终止。\n[[GGYGO_结构_AbilitySystem.canvas|结构]] · [[AbilitySystem/结构|接口]] · [[计划_玩家普攻连段|连段说明]] · [[GGYGO_流程_原请求终止.canvas|终止]] · [[GGYGO_流程_能力仲裁.canvas|仲裁]] · [[GGYGO_流程_伤害结算.canvas|结算]]","x":-310,"y":-140,"width":1650,"height":210,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"check","type":"text","text":"3. 原生 Try 准入与 GA::CanActivateAbility（final）。\n\n每层 Can 独立评估，在原核心检查的外调前认领本次输入许可。\nActorInfo → Super::CanActivateAbility（原 GAS/BP、冷却、成本、Tag）→ ASC::IsActivationBlockedByGroup → CanActivateAbilityAdditional。\n返回前封闭本层结果；QueryOnly／嵌套 raw 无输入重试证明。\n原生前置拒绝未进 Can 时也走 Notify，先耗尽匹配许可。\n组规则见 [[GGYGO_流程_能力仲裁.canvas|仲裁子图]]。","x":940,"y":258,"width":400,"height":400,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"end","type":"text","text":"5. 固定Original→RequestEnd/Cancel。\nfinal End一次Cleanup(Context)→native End；派生只归还自己的原资源，Task执行自身清理。\nGA早通知→UE重置Task登记→ASC原Ended→所有实际调用/原Try退出→封存/退Busy→项目Completed。\n组空或Task Completed均不是原Notice。\n[[GGYGO_流程_原请求终止.canvas|真实时点/失败分支]]","x":-100,"y":1047,"width":400,"height":390,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"active","type":"text","text":"4. Native NotifyAbilityActivated → GA签Original，ASC登记sequence/预留。\nActiveCount++ → final Activate核原参数，Initialize(Original)一次初始化原批次。\n原来源仍有效→Finalize终检/完成原attempt→相机/offset→Body(Original,原参数)，默认native Super/BP。\n每个外调返回重核Original；结束/Busy/来源改变不执行旧Body。派生持自己的原Task/窗口/句柄。\n[[GGYGO_流程_原请求终止.canvas|原来源与全退出]]","x":940,"y":992,"width":420,"height":430,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"fail","type":"text","text":"拒绝：NotifyAbilityFailed（final）。\n复制FailureTags→精确一次消费本层评估／完整原来源→Super原失败反馈。\n真实Queued且来源仍有效→OnAbilityInputRetryable(const OriginalRetry&)。\nHero核原ID/Tag/绝对deadline/Binding再缓冲/Queue；不用-1或最近Tag补来源。\nHandleAbilityFailed→GA Native／Script；客户端原失败路由保留。\nraw/Query、错对象/已消费/过期不发Retry；Clear推进revision，弱端点/World/Owner/Avatar失效拒绝旧来源。","x":1920,"y":242,"width":420,"height":490,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"ability-input-ordered-edge-flow","type":"text","text":"## Process输入消费\nReceive冻结原ID/Tag/deadline及首次Spec集合，记录真实原边沿；多个原来源held按OR保持。\nProcess外调前捕原Edges，按每个EdgeIndex冻结InitialSourcesByEdge；Press A→Release A→Press B不让未来B进入A的Can来源。\n同边沿来源OR→同Spec本批最多一次Try；真实剩余边沿进入既有DeferredEdges，下一引擎PostProcess消费，无第二Tick。\n原InputScope/Origin包住一次受控Try；Retryable仍先清，bNativeAccepted成功消费。Busy/Rejected不raw重试，remote接受非本地Activation证明。\nTry只武装自己的许可→final Can独立评估→final Notify消费本层原来源；Query/raw不能借外层。\n真实Queued→完整原Retry通知；Queue核原ID/Tag/deadline＋许可，FiniteRetry不重开窗口。\nReleased最后held才释放，未过期tap可retry；Invalidated不伪Released，deadline过期不松键。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#单次 Can 评估与输入失败来源（B0）|输入接口]]","x":2380,"y":-183,"width":700,"height":670,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"damage","type":"text","text":"原Owned hit→共享Builder。\nCombo显式无GE成功载荷直接Cue；Boss要求有效GE。有效Spec走GE／Execution／HealthSet元属性，并保留碰撞Cue。\n必需依赖／Builder失败不Apply/Cue：Combo正式End固定Original，Boss只拒该hit。\nHealthSet的Current目标／ASC计算／原Base提交见本图下方数值分支。\n[[GGYGO_流程_伤害结算.canvas|命中分支]] · [[Messages/结构#HealthSet 的 Current 结算|Current结算]]","x":2000,"y":992,"width":420,"height":360,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"w0-original-input-subscription-flow","type":"text","text":"## 原输入Task订阅流程\n调用方：WaitComboInput→SetSourceStep→可选RegisterNativeCallback→ReadyForActivation；工厂/BP签名保持。native闭包按值捕原Activation、弱GA/原Task。\n① Activate外调前捕原弱ASC/Ability、Spec/key、remote/predict模式、自身handle→原桶AbilityReplicatedEventDelegate(InputPressed).Add。零key合法，只定位桶。\n② remote CallReplicatedEventDelegateIfSet返回→重取弱原Task，核开放/原订阅/来源/handle→未回放才最后SetWaitingOnRemotePlayerData；A结束不能写Waiting。\n③ HandlePress：remote GetReplicatedDataOfGenericReplicatedEvent；本地计数，predict才ServerSetReplicatedEventWithPayload→ConsumeGenericReplicatedEvent，均原Spec/key。\nX[0,65535]／Y[1,65535]整数校验保持，非法载荷诊断并消费原事件后拒绝通知。原FScopedPredictionWindow覆盖通知。\n原Consume→不可变native/载荷快照→native与捕获析构返回→弱原Task/精确原订阅重检→原OnPress BP；native结束A不发A BP。\n④ OnDestroy先关、脱native及订阅→原桶remove自身handle→Super返回→释放捕获，之后无Task访问；不Consume后继。\n必需来源非法诊断/结束自身，不从GA current补桶，不新增GA身份或调度。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#原事件桶与输入Task订阅（W0）|订阅接口]]","x":1945,"y":1422,"width":950,"height":430,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"k3-play-result","type":"text","text":"## 1｜Task先决契约与完整播放返回\n创建Task后、Ready前RegisterNativeCallbacks→精确token：原五普通回调＋SectionReceived／NotifyReceived＋typed OnFailed。原Activation/弱GA/原Task由调用方固定捕获。\nActivate捕原Ability/ActorInfo allocation/ASC/Mesh/Anim与Montage真实唯一Slot。\n→原Guard.AcquireActionPoseContract：ExplicitNotRequired明确普通模式；RequiredReady须有效原Ticket/失败消费者；Rejected/Unavailable或Ticket不一致→Startup失败(ID=NONE)，不播放。\n原资格有效→自身Cancel/Event订阅→TryPlayMontageWithOwnership(原参数/pureQuery)。\nASC捕源→GuardScope→完整Super.PlayMontage→Complete→复制Result并退出Scope；Accepted且真实Local/原源一致才签Playback。\nTask消费同一栈Result；失败/Superseded不清后继、不裸播放/扫描新实例或假Duration成功。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构|接口输入输出]] · [[Animation/动作姿态修正|声明与Acquire]]\n显式作者点订阅在Ready前ConfigureOriginalMontageNotify；声明、派发与清理见右侧分支。","x":3320,"y":600,"width":950,"height":392,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"k4publish","type":"text","text":"一次发布与GA通知流程\n1. Host在Install并公布原资源后调用PublishAvatarBindingNotice(原Receipt,pureQuery)；原Dispatching桥接Extension Ready，Hero消费typed本地H。\n2. 捕获历史副本，核对真实Proof、Pending、完整Context／LastWrite、实际ActorInfo和生命周期；每次Query外调前后重检，查询闭包不持久保存。\n3. 原记录置Dispatching → OnAvatarBindingNotice的唯一原生Broadcast(Receipt, Notice)。接收者仍须校验真实派发及自己的原资源；派发期间不占原生Busy。\n4. 事件后重检；仅原Init＋不同的新有效Pawn进入GA通知。同Pawn Init／Refresh／Clear不走首次出生分支。\n5. 每项原SpecHandle＋弱实例候选：Recheck → FindAbilitySpecFromHandle(..., EConsiderPending::None)＋原实例成员核对 → OnPawnAvatarSet → Recheck。已移除／待移除／脱离原Spec跳过。\n6. OnPawn后重收集Spawn Handle；每项Recheck → 查非PendingRemove原Spec并复制 → TryActivateAbilityOnSpawn：保留OnSpawn/未Active/Avatar/网络端选择，合格后一次项目ASC.TryActivateAbilityWithTerminationBoundary(Handle)；非法/非项目ASC诊断拒绝，无raw回退 → Recheck；不跨外调保留容器引用。\nNativeAccepted不等于本地Activation或Completed。GA以共同原身份与final入口执行：Initialize一次初始化原批次，原准入/相机后Body默认native Super/BP；外调返回核固定Original，结束/Busy不进入旧业务。[[AbilitySystem/结构#激活薄hook与OnSpawn受控入口|接口与门禁]]\n7. 回调内B合法接管：A返回原历史bCommitted=true＋Stale；原Proof／Context作用域仅撤A，不能清B或继续A通知。纯Query或实际字段失败同样明确关闭原许可。\n8. 最后精确重检 → Consumed并释放当前强Proof引用，只保留派发来源元数据；IsAvatarBindingPublicationContextCurrent仍不等于全局Ready。\n9. 原凭据派发中重入：Busy／PublicationInProgress；成功消费后再发：Rejected／PublicationAlreadyConsumed。Pending／Closed／历史不能通过真实派发认证。","x":0,"y":2130,"width":1850,"height":390,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"k3-original-resource","type":"text","text":"## 2｜原资源安装与Required-only只读Poll\n原返回重检Task/Ability/ActorInfo；在途停止义务按Result.Guard清原实例。已结束Task不安装资源。\n成功→保存原Handle/Guard/ID→精确BlendOut/Ended/Section委托与配置的原NotifyBegin订阅→原scale lease→SetWaitingOnAvatar；最后外调后无成员写。\nReady返回：GA用TryGetOriginalSectionSnapshot固定实际ID/Section/Position/Rate，GA按原范围调用CMC BeginMontageActionMotion；SectionReceived报告原转段。\n仅RequiredReady启用原GameplayTasks Tick；TickTask不消费dt或求姿态，只向原Guard.PollActionPoseContract。\nPoll前后核原Task/Ability/ActorInfo/ASC/Guard；Valid继续，Failed/Invalidated→Playback失败(原ID)，不重新Acquire或静默跳过弱来源丢失。\n普通Event/Section仍核精确原实例和自身资格；票据不是播放/GA权力，CMC仍唯一胶囊执行。\n[[GGYGO_流程_玩家普攻连段.canvas|Main/End消费]] · [[Animation/动作姿态修正|姿态执行/epoch]]","x":3320,"y":1297,"width":950,"height":340,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"k3-exact-clear","type":"text","text":"## 3｜原BlendOut精确Clear\n原实例携Guard回调→MatchesOriginalMontageCallback→标混出，释放自身缩放。\nTask→TryClearMontageAnimatingAbility(原Handle)。Check通过→qualified基类GA.SetCurrentMontage(null)→Local.AnimatingAbility=null→核对→退休Proof。\n旧A不匹配当前B返回Stale／原因；B停止后仍可清自己。\n不进virtual业务setter后盲清Local，不Stop／延期到技能结束。\n原BlendOut/Interrupted：原包/载荷快照→native及捕获析构返回→弱原Task、同原Guard/ActorInfo/Task资格重检→既有BP；原Task关闭不继续旧BP。\n[[AbilitySystem/计划_AbilitySystem#当前精确Montage增量（K3）|播放接口]]","x":3320,"y":1920,"width":950,"height":290,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"k3-task-original-ended","type":"text","text":"## 4｜自然结束、普通取消与Required失败\n自然原Ended：原Guard生命周期/ActorInfo/Task资格成立且非Interrupted→原包/载荷快照→native/捕获析构返回→原资格重检→BP Completed→自身EndTask。\n不Check已退休当前ASC归属，不要求原实例仍活动。Completed只原实例事实；GA另核Original，不授后继结束权。\n普通ExternalCancel/AbilityCancel/FailAndEndTask保持Cancelled与原Stop策略，各渠道至多一次。\nRequired失败独立路径：关闭普通Event/Section/完成入口→精确Stop原实例/释放scale→EndTask清自身订阅/Ticket→历史typed OnFailed。\nFact=原Montage/真实Slot/Stage/Diagnostic；Startup NONE，Playback确切原ID。\nUE EndTask已清Task.Ability并垃圾标记；历史发送者WeakTask.Get(true)拒RF销毁，GA核原激活/段/强Task/原资源，随后正式原End(true,true)。不能用live-Task/Guard门禁吞失败。\nnative消费者若真实结束原激活/同UObject接续，临时原End观察使旧BP不交付；无原End且历史资格成立才BP OnFailed。\nOnDestroy先关/脱包，再原AnimInstance自身NotifyBegin及Cancel/Event/实例/scale/Ticket清理；Tick标志保持到引擎退休登记，捕获释放后无旧Task写。\n普通停止仍按原Guard/ID，ASC认证且活动ID同原才CurrentMontageStop，否则仅精确本地原资源；不找当前Avatar/后继。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#Task原实例与资源消费|Task契约]] · [[计划_玩家普攻连段|失败接收]]","x":3320,"y":2450,"width":950,"height":430,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"montage-notify-configure","type":"text","text":"## 原作者点的pre-Ready配置\n调用方→ResolveOriginalMontageNotify(Montage,Name,OutTime,Diagnostic)。\n恰一同名stock UAnimNotify_PlayMontageNotify；原LinkedMontage／branchingpoint／含offset有限TriggerTime，无同名Window／子类／重复。\nConfigureOriginalMontageNotify(Name,Diagnostic)仅原AwaitingActivation一次；保存原Notify UObject／名字／时间。\nReady前原RegisterNativeCallbacks包提供NotifyReceived。\nActivate复核声明与消费者；失败不播放，不以Main／End／旧ASC事件替代。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#原生 Montage 作者信号|配置与失败]]","x":4760,"y":747,"width":930,"height":245,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"montage-notify-subscribe","type":"text","text":"## 成功原Result后安装订阅\nTryPlayMontageWithOwnership返回→重核原Task/Ability/ActorInfo。\n成功→原Playback／Guard／int32 ID→确切原实例。\n声明仍匹配→原ActivatedAnimInstance.OnPlayMontageNotifyBegin.AddDynamic(本Task,OnOriginalMontageNotifyBegin)。\n播放外调后声明改变→清原播放、重取弱原Task后FailAndEndTask。\n不查同资产当前播放、不接ASC CancelPoint；Ready返回可读快照，原native点触发则核payload。","x":5250,"y":1450,"width":880,"height":270,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"montage-notify-startup-snapshot","type":"text","text":"## Ready后读取原位置\nGA核原Activation／StepToken／Task／资源→TryGetOriginalMontageNotifySnapshot(Fact,Position)。\n原Task／Guard／ActorInfo／声明有效→按固定ID读仍存在的原实例，位置须有限。\n输出原Montage／Mesh／ID／Name／作者TriggerTime及实际Position；false清输出。\nGA待同原Scope／CMC Handle就绪后解释非零纠正起点是否已越点；早期原信号也留在同原资源。\n不合成Notify／ASC事件、不锁业务门、不查询后继。\n[[GGYGO_流程_玩家普攻连段.canvas|GA初始化消费]]","x":6680,"y":1450,"width":900,"height":240,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"montage-notify-authenticate","type":"text","text":"## 原native点→精确原来源\nUE UAnimNotify_PlayMontageNotify.BranchingPointNotify→原AnimInstance.OnPlayMontageNotifyBegin。\nOnOriginalMontageNotifyBegin核Name、原Mesh／Montage、非NONE int32原ID。\npayload.NotifyEvent必须是当前原Notifies数组配置单点，原Notify UObject／TriggerTime一致。\nCanDispatchOriginalInstanceFact核原Guard Call／Lifecycle、ActorInfo及Task开放，精确原实例仍存在。\n自然blend不走IsNotifyValid，不要求已退休ASC当前归属；退休Task／旧ID／后继拒绝。\n只复制FGGYGOMontageNotifyFact来源值，不外传借用的UE payload。","x":5250,"y":1860,"width":880,"height":260,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"montage-notify-deliver","type":"text","text":"## 原包派发与消费\nDispatchOriginalMontageNotifyFact先捕弱原Task／Ability／ASC、原Guard并重核。\n共享不可变FNativeCallbacks包→NotifyReceived.ExecuteIfBound(Fact)。\nnative及快照捕获析构返回→重取原Task／重核来源与实例，才NotifyReceived.Broadcast(Fact)。\n原Task关闭不继续旧BP；BP返回后无Task访问。\nGA另核原Activation／StepToken／Task／资源，持本播放许可并请求原执行接口；事实不授GA／输入／镜头／CMC工作权。\n[[GGYGO_流程_玩家普攻连段.canvas|原资源业务门]]","x":6640,"y":1860,"width":900,"height":270,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"montage-notify-rejected","type":"text","text":"## 原声明／来源拒绝\nResolve／Configure失败→false、清输出与Diagnostic，调用方处理原配置失败。\nActivate声明失效或缺消费者→FailAndEndTask，保持Cancelled语义，不播放。\n播放外调后声明改变→精确停原资源、重检原Task后失败。\nnative来源不符／旧ID／退休Task→不派发、不授门。\n快照不可读→false清两输出，调用方定位原资源失败。\n不借End／另一通知／float事件兜底，不恢复旧工作权。","x":4600,"y":2605,"width":930,"height":235,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"montage-notify-retire","type":"text","text":"## 原Task退休清理\n原自然Ended／取消或调用方退Task→OnDestroy。\n先关闭入口并脱原native包→原ActivatedAnimInstance.RemoveDynamic(本Task,OnOriginalMontageNotifyBegin)。\n只撤原对象／自身函数；UE动态多播无FDelegateHandle，不Clear全表、不查新AnimInstance。\n按原策略退自己的Cancel/Event／实例／scale／Ticket→Super返回→释放捕获，之后无Task写。\n晚到原payload及已退休Task不污染同资产新播放。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#原生 Montage 作者信号|订阅寿命]]","x":6640,"y":2360,"width":900,"height":245,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"k4-committed-cleanup-entry","type":"text","text":"## A1｜捕获原提交清理范围\nHost Release或自己已提交的失败收尾捕原H/完整Context/弱端点；Extension先Withdraw自己的原H。\n原Closing资源按清理资格核对，不使用工作Ready。\n→ CheckAvatarBindingCleanupContext(Expected, OutReason)。\n输入必须原Issuer＋Binding/LastWrite，不读后继Context补权限。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#原已提交清理来源（Destroy）|已提交来源]]","x":-440,"y":4100,"width":600,"height":215,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"k4-committed-cleanup-actions","type":"text","text":"## A3｜原Context动作依次返回\nHost → TryCancelAvatarBindingAbilities(Expected, With/Without, pureScope)\n→ 原范围ClearAbilityInput\n→ TryRemoveAvatarBindingGameplayCues(Expected, pureScope)，仍用旧Avatar。\nCancel/Cue仅MatchCommittedCleanupContext；原native Busy中query前后/完整Super返回重检→Complete。\n不commit/Receipt/Notice；失去原scope或source即停止，不清后继。","x":1830,"y":4070,"width":620,"height":245,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"k4-committed-cleanup-clear","type":"text","text":"## A4｜调用方显式Clear模式\nHost捕原Host/Owner关闭事实，关闭→ClearActorInfo；正常保Owner→PreserveOwner。\n→ TryExecuteAvatarActorInfoTransaction(Clear, OutPublication)。\nquery/原操作核对→ClearAbilityInput监听者返回后写前重检→退休旧源→qualified native。\nPreserveOwner遇关闭Owner/宿主明确LifecycleClosed，不错误后换模式重试。","x":2920,"y":4070,"width":620,"height":230,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"k4-committed-cleanup-result","type":"text","text":"## A5｜typed Clear实际提交出口\n原Super完整返回/重检→Commit→bCommitted=true及Released Receipt。\nHost仅退自己的原H/订阅，再Publish/NotifyLocalResourcesReleased沿既有规则；失败历史不回滚后继。\nClear不重开已关闭组件宿主；cleanup query成功不等于Ready或新工作。","x":4240,"y":4105,"width":820,"height":160,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"k4-committed-cleanup-mode-rejected","type":"text","text":"## A模式拒绝｜LifecycleClosed\n显式PreserveOwner碰关闭Owner/组件宿主→原失败。\n调用方事先选择的ClearActorInfo是正常模式，不是失败后的替代路径；ASC不自动换Mode/排队/重试。","x":2920,"y":4690,"width":620,"height":190,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"k4-failed-init-capture","type":"text","text":"## B1｜native Init完整返回即捕获\n普通/Bootstrap/Replace的同一common Init执行器、原Operation、既有native Busy。\nqualified Super::InitAbilityActorInfo完整返回\n→ CaptureReturnedAvatarActorInfoInitCleanup(原操作)。\n原pending身份/Kind Init、原allocation、原请求Owner/Avatar及ASC缓存匹配，保存完整WrittenActual。\n候选捕获先于后续caller query/Commit；不是Ready校验。","x":-1360,"y":5393,"width":600,"height":265,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"k4-failed-init-commit-branch","type":"text","text":"## B2｜原返回检查与Commit分支\n执行器沿原操作query前后重检，再TryCommitAvatarBindingActorInfoIdentity。\n成功Commit：丢弃失败cleanup候选，走既有Receipt/Publish规则。\n未commit失败且native完整返回：保留原失败Result.Operation，尝试RetainFailedAvatarActorInfoInitCleanup(候选)。\n预写入失败/未完整返回不签原写入Proof。","x":40,"y":5393,"width":620,"height":226,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"k4-failed-init-retain","type":"text","text":"## B3｜仅保留仍精确匹配的失败Proof\n原Context元数据等于Before、未commit为该Operation，原allocation/完整WrittenActual仍匹配。\n成员const Proof：OriginalOperation＋Before＋WrittenActual；原Init结果仍失败。\n后继真实typed/准入legacy写入退休Proof；拒绝/预写入失败不替既有实际源。清理入口不重捕或用旧Context补造。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#失败Init原写入清理（未提交证明）|未提交来源]]","x":1440,"y":5344,"width":620,"height":275,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"k4-failed-init-consume","type":"text","text":"## B4｜核原Proof并一次消费\n调用方 → TryCleanupFailedAvatarActorInfoInit(原Operation, pureOriginalCallerQuery)。\n拒绝缺Query/无效ASC/Busy；核成员原Proof/Issuer/Before/allocation/全部实际字段，无较新commit/写入。\n进入既有单native Busy；query前后重检原源，不借工作Ready/关闭Owner门槛。\n关匹配发布许可→先消费Proof/退休旧来源及Montage→唯一qualified Super::ClearActorInfo。\nnative后失败不重新签Proof，不回滚/自动重试。","x":3000,"y":5344,"width":700,"height":280,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"k4-failed-init-postcondition","type":"text","text":"## B5｜核真实Clear后置条件\n原ASC/Before元数据、无新Proof/活动操作；allocation与其余原字段精确相同。\nOwner/Avatar/PC/Mesh/Movement、cached Owner/Avatar、实际GetAnimInstance为空；raw ActorInfo::AnimInstance与Tag按GAS保留。\n再pure原query，前后重检Cleared快照。\n全部成立→Succeeded/None、原Operation/Before，bCommitted=false、CommittedContext空。\n只证明原写入物理cleanup；无Receipt/Notice/Ready，原Init仍失败。","x":4480,"y":5342,"width":740,"height":280,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"k4-failed-init-success-commit","type":"text","text":"## B成功Commit｜既有事务出口\n只有实际Commit成功才创建历史Receipt及当前发布记录，失败Proof不保留。\n按原Publish认证/通知规则执行，不从cleanup路径制造Ready。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#单次发布与回调资源归属|既有发布规则]]","x":40,"y":5940,"width":620,"height":160,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"numeric-authority-current-target","type":"text","text":"## 权威Current目标\nDamage／Healing／PoiseDamage：\nPreGameplayEffectExecute先调用ASC计算Current→同Current，只预检支持性；Ready不保存候选，不写资源属性。\nPre拒绝→拒绝该Modifier；接受→原GE写meta。\nPostGameplayEffectExecute清自身meta贡献，等待该原生回调返回，再重读Current／Max并按MinimumHealth与0～Max生成目标。\n权威Max下降且Current超界→TrySetCurrentValue目标为新Max。\n[[Messages/结构#HealthSet 的 Current 结算|HealthSet目标与原帧]]","x":-880,"y":6760,"width":700,"height":280,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"numeric-native-base-calculation","type":"text","text":"## ASC原生薄计算\nHealthSet→TryCalculateNumericAttributeBaseForCurrentValue(this, Attribute, ExpectedCurrent, DesiredCurrent)。\n核游戏线程／权威／原注册Set和FGameplayAttributeData／有限输入。\nnative Capture→原默认与CustomQualifies资格→本次栈内原生通道。\n原生SumMods及Compound／Gain求值：非法Divisor、零或原生拒绝的倍率、有效Override、非有限值→Rejected。\n通道逆序native bool ReverseEvaluate；候选正序native求值必须匹配DesiredCurrent。\n重新capture实际聚合器→native正向回验→重核原宿主／Base／Current与修饰项资格；改变→Stale。\n通过→Ready／None及有限CalculatedBase；不调用setter。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#Current 与 Base 数值接口|ASC接口]]","x":850,"y":6725,"width":840,"height":350,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"numeric-health-native-base-write","type":"text","text":"## HealthSet提交原Base\nTrySetCurrentValue仅消费即时Ready／None；原batch未开放且原源有效才提交。\nPushExpectedAttributeChange保存本次属性来源。\nASC.SetNumericAttributeBase(Attribute, CalculatedBase)\n→GAS写有限内部Base→原聚合器dirty求值\n→PreAttributeChange应用Current边界\n→PostAttributeChange记录本次ObservedCurrent。\n原setter返回后Pop标记；不把后读GetCurrent当本次结果。","x":2480,"y":6725,"width":740,"height":280,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"numeric-own-post-confirmed","type":"text","text":"## 本次Post确认\n标记确实观察到原写入、输入未拒绝且ObservedCurrent有限／匹配DesiredCurrent→本次提交成立。\nHealthSet保留原委托与结果顺序；Damage消息沿原幅度和原帧发布。\nnative回调后的嵌套治疗／direct写入是另一真实事实，不能替换本次ObservedCurrent。\n确认失败→明确诊断；只撤本帧尚未确认的Damage候选。\n[[Messages/结构#HealthSet 的 Current 结算|结果与消息消费]]","x":4240,"y":6725,"width":680,"height":280,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"numeric-current-write-rejected","type":"text","text":"## 拒绝或来源失效\nPre支持性计算Rejected／Stale→该meta Modifier不进入存储。\nPost计算Rejected／Stale→不提交候选Base，明确原因。\nnative提交未确认→明确失败，不伪发本帧Damage成功消息。\n已发生的meta清理／嵌套写入保留真实结果，不宣称整GE原子回滚。\n不旁写Current、不移除Buff、不采用不可逆float回落或补偿。","x":850,"y":7440,"width":840,"height":230,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"numeric-client-same-base","type":"text","text":"## 原Base重求值\n重读实际Base／Current／Max并核有限。\nCurrent≤Max→无需投影；Current>Max→安装本次依赖来源标记。\nASC.SetNumericAttributeBase(Attribute, SameBase)\n→GAS保留原GE／预测修饰求值\n→PreAttributeChange限Current→真实Post记录。\n标记确认实际有限Current落在0～Max；失败明确诊断。\n原变化委托保留，自身投影不伪发业务消息；真实嵌套GE／direct写入继续正常配对。\n不调用权威逆算，不加Tick／Timer／RPC或第二复制调度器。","x":1790,"y":7880,"width":840,"height":290,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"numeric-client-max-receive","type":"text","text":"## 客户端Max依赖请求\nOnRep_MaxHealth／MaxPoise或有效Max Post→RequestClientMaxReevaluation。\n本PreNetReceive固定弱Owner／ASC；请求绑定本次FNetReceiveFrame。\nSuper::PostNetReceive排空原生dirty后，先退休本次请求，再重核原源并调用ReevaluateClientMax。\n无NetReceive且native batch关闭→沿同一同步入口；来源失效／仍开放batch→明确失败。\n[[Messages/结构#客户端上限的 NetReceive 投影|复制生命周期]]","x":40,"y":7910,"width":840,"height":260,"color":"4"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"e1","fromNode":"grant","fromSide":"right","toNode":"request","toSide":"left","label":"GiveToAbilitySystem → SpecHandle"},
		{"id":"e2","fromNode":"request","fromSide":"right","toNode":"check","toSide":"left","label":"Process / OnSpawn / Boss BT → 一次TryActivateAbilityWithTerminationBoundary"},
		{"id":"e3","fromNode":"check","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"active","toSide":"top","label":"实际NotifyActivated签Original；ActiveCount++后final Activate/Initialize"},
		{"id":"e4","fromNode":"check","fromSide":"right","toNode":"fail","toSide":"left","label":"Can=false / 原生前置拒绝 → NotifyAbilityFailed"},
		{"id":"e5","fromNode":"active","fromSide":"left","toNode":"end","toSide":"right","label":"固定Original原结束请求；全调用退出后才发布项目Completed"},
		{"id":"e6","fromNode":"active","fromSide":"right","toNode":"damage","toSide":"left","label":"Owned窗口原hit订阅→Builder；成功载荷再请求GE/Cue"},
		{"id":"e7","fromNode":"end","fromSide":"top","toNode":"request","toSide":"bottom","label":"OnAbilityGroupFreed→Hero核原ID/Tag/期限→Queue完整Retry；不是终止Completed"},
		{"id":"e8","fromNode":"k4flow","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"k4publish","toSide":"top","label":"Host Install/公布原H→Publish/Dispatching桥接Ready"},
		{"id":"e-request-ordered-edge-detail","fromNode":"request","fromSide":"top","toNode":"ability-input-ordered-edge-flow","toSide":"left","label":"展开Receive→有序Process→本次Can来源；不增执行链"},
		{"id":"k3-play-source","fromNode":"k3-play-result","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"k3-original-resource","toSide":"top","label":"Succeeded才有ASC签发原Playback；其它只保留本次失败历史"},
		{"id":"k3-source-clear","fromNode":"k3-original-resource","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"k3-exact-clear","toSide":"top","label":"原Guard BlendOut→TryClear原Handle；GA捕原资源，派生Context归还"},
		{"id":"k3-clear-then-original-ended","fromNode":"k3-exact-clear","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"k3-task-original-ended","toSide":"top","label":"原实例稍后Ended：事实委托仍有效，不重新要求已退休ASC归属"},
		{"id":"k4-cleanup-a-entry-check","fromNode":"k4-committed-cleanup-entry","fromSide":"right","toNode":"k4-committed-cleanup-check","toSide":"left","label":"纯核对原已提交Context"},
		{"id":"k4-cleanup-a-check-actions","fromNode":"k4-committed-cleanup-check","fromSide":"right","toNode":"k4-committed-cleanup-actions","toSide":"left","label":"原提交cleanup认证成功"},
		{"id":"k4-cleanup-a-actions-clear","fromNode":"k4-committed-cleanup-actions","fromSide":"right","toNode":"k4-committed-cleanup-clear","toSide":"left","label":"每步成功且原源仍有效"},
		{"id":"k4-cleanup-a-clear-result","fromNode":"k4-committed-cleanup-clear","fromSide":"right","toNode":"k4-committed-cleanup-result","toSide":"left","label":"显式模式合法／native完整返回并Commit"},
		{"id":"k4-cleanup-a-check-stale","fromNode":"k4-committed-cleanup-check","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"k4-committed-cleanup-stale","toSide":"top","label":"原身份／字段不符或ASC失效"},
		{"id":"k4-cleanup-a-actions-stale","fromNode":"k4-committed-cleanup-actions","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"k4-committed-cleanup-stale","toSide":"right","label":"原Query／返回重检失效"},
		{"id":"k4-cleanup-a-clear-mode-rejected","fromNode":"k4-committed-cleanup-clear","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"k4-committed-cleanup-mode-rejected","toSide":"top","label":"PreserveOwner遇关闭Owner／宿主"},
		{"id":"k4-cleanup-b-capture-commit","fromNode":"k4-failed-init-capture","fromSide":"right","toNode":"k4-failed-init-commit-branch","toSide":"left","label":"原native已完整返回，候选在后续外调前捕获"},
		{"id":"k4-cleanup-b-commit-success","fromNode":"k4-failed-init-commit-branch","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"k4-failed-init-success-commit","toSide":"top","label":"实际Commit成功"},
		{"id":"k4-cleanup-b-commit-failed","fromNode":"k4-failed-init-commit-branch","fromSide":"right","toNode":"k4-failed-init-retain","toSide":"left","label":"未commit失败，保留真实原Operation"},
		{"id":"k4-cleanup-b-retain-no-proof","fromNode":"k4-failed-init-retain","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"k4-failed-init-no-proof","toSide":"top","label":"无法精确认证返回时原写入"},
		{"id":"k4-cleanup-b-retain-consume","fromNode":"k4-failed-init-retain","fromSide":"right","toNode":"k4-failed-init-consume","toSide":"left","label":"已保存的原Proof；调用方提交原Operation与pureScope"},
		{"id":"k4-cleanup-b-clear-postcondition","fromNode":"k4-failed-init-consume","fromSide":"right","toNode":"k4-failed-init-postcondition","toSide":"left","label":"Proof已消费／唯一native Clear完整返回"},
		{"id":"k4-cleanup-b-entry-failure","fromNode":"k4-failed-init-consume","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"k4-failed-init-cleanup-failure","toSide":"top","label":"写前原Proof或pureQuery失效"},
		{"id":"k4-cleanup-b-after-clear-failure","fromNode":"k4-failed-init-postcondition","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"k4-failed-init-cleanup-failure","toSide":"top","label":"native后检查／第二次原Query失败"},
		{"id":"w0-active-create-input-task","fromNode":"active","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"w0-original-input-subscription-flow","toSide":"left","label":"GA创建WaitComboInput→可选RegisterNativeCallback→ReadyForActivation"},
		{"id":"numeric-post-asks-base-calculation","fromNode":"numeric-authority-current-target","fromSide":"right","toNode":"numeric-native-base-calculation","toSide":"left","label":"Post／权威Max的即时ExpectedCurrent与DesiredCurrent"},
		{"id":"numeric-ready-native-write","fromNode":"numeric-native-base-calculation","fromSide":"right","toNode":"numeric-health-native-base-write","toSide":"left","label":"Ready／None：立即提交有限CalculatedBase"},
		{"id":"numeric-original-post-result","fromNode":"numeric-health-native-base-write","fromSide":"right","toNode":"numeric-own-post-confirmed","toSide":"left","label":"读取自身标记ObservedCurrent，不借嵌套后的Current"},
		{"id":"numeric-calculation-failure","fromNode":"numeric-native-base-calculation","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"numeric-current-write-rejected","toSide":"top","label":"Rejected／Stale与明确Reason"},
